Hello,

I've tagged and pushed man-pages-3.49 to kernel.org.

This release is a little unusual. There are no content changes in this
release: the release consists purely of changes to comments inside the
source of every manual page, in order to arrange the copyright and
license sections into a standard order. The intent is to make it
easier for scripts to parse the manual page sources to obtain the
copyright and license of a page

Cheers,

Michael


